# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What stays on your machine and never goes to GitHub.
# Everything else in the repo (skills/, tools/, assets/sfx/, vendor/earshot/,
# the example styles and the reference analyses) is meant to be shared.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---- Your own memory -------------------------------------------------------
# Brand answers, notes and styles learned from your own videos.
# memory/README.md and memory/intake.json (the empty question list) are shared.
memory/*
!memory/README.md
!memory/intake.json
!memory/styles/
memory/styles/*
# Example styles that ship with the repo (learned from public reference videos)
!memory/styles/reference-explainers/
!memory/styles/joseph-clean-canvas/
!memory/styles/kallaway-dark-studio/
!memory/styles/ritesh-white-diagram/
!memory/styles/nafay-screen-tutorial/
!memory/styles/orange-canvas-reel/

# ---- Your edits, renders and media ----------------------------------------
# Working folders for each video: your footage, voice, renders, deliveries.
work/
out/
renders/
exports/
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.m4a
*.aac
*.wav.pre.wav
*.log.json
# Resolve and editor project files
*.drp
*.drt
*.prproj
*.fcpbundle/

# ---- Other people's videos -------------------------------------------------
# The downloads themselves and anything rebuilt from them.
reference/source/
reference/analysis/*/_tmp/
reference/analysis/*/frames.npz
reference/motion-graphics/*/_tmp/
reference/motion-graphics/*/frames.npz
reference/motion-graphics/*/sheets30/
# Working evidence that can be rebuilt from the source videos
reference/analysis/*/dense/
reference/analysis/*/overview/
reference/analysis/*/*.log
reference/analysis/*/findings.txt

# ---- Paid or unlicensed sound packs ----------------------------------------
# Only the free, licensed packs in assets/sfx/ are shared. Keep any pack you
# downloaded elsewhere (for example "500+ Sound Effects") and music beds here.
assets/sfx/private/
music/

# ---- Secrets and personal settings -----------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets/
*.local.json
*.local.md
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/settings.local.json

# ---- Downloaded models and caches ------------------------------------------
tools/models/
vendor/earshot/.cache/
vendor/earshot/*.egg-info/
vendor/*.log

# ---- Python, Node and OS clutter -------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
node_modules/
*.bak
*.tmp
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
